{
  "id": "NUM.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Iitooda 26",
  "verseCount": 65,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iitooda buuneeda bea iyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ning'ata lasoodida, goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Musa ea Eliyasari, orjeeda Haruni was ashoohoocheanda, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi iita ak ginyasi mooneeda fuga sean bwatgeat bea Israeli, ghang'eada gea bea gweanyeew diktam, ea gea naawa, aba gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, fuga sean bea jeeda Israeli ammu gwarita gaweay ng'ucheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalool Musa ea Eleyasareeda was ashoohoocheanda fugiga aba ng'eanyiida awiida bea Moabu neekeewa eenda Yordani, aba Yeriko, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi iita buuneeda, nea giing'eadi gea bea gweanyeew diktam, ea gea naawa,” gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa. Fuga Israeli rinna ng'eanyiida Misri, suhu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rubeni gil, was duweacheeda Israeli; orjooga Rubeni; gea Hanoki, fuga gheeh Hanoki; ea gea Balu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Hesroni, ea fuga gheeh Hesroni; ea gea Garmi, ea fuga gheeh Garmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga gheeh Rubeni; nea mooneeda nyaawa ea sagalamnyooji haradam ea samwagu ea bughalaji ispwa ea diktam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jeacheenga Balu ea Eliyabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jeacheenga Nemueli ea Datani, ea Abiramu. Suh Datani gil ea Abiramu was gea loat aba jeeda eemeeda bwatgeat, was fuga ng'aleali sea Musa ea Haruni ak gaguuyi sea fuga Gora, damanda ng'alealeewa sea NG'UTAMIIDA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoabwara ghuutaanyi ng'eanyiida ak ghwanukghuta saawa ea Gora, sea fuga aat geeshta damanda aga beasta fih bughalaji iyeenya ea haradam ea damanamughuush, ak ghoah miinda gheang'da aba heeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwasa, orjooga Gora mameewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eemeeda Simeoni ea fuga gheanyaawa, gea Nemueli, ea Yamini, ea Yakini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sera ea Shauli, ea fuga gheeh Shauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Simeoni, buuneeda ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya ea bughalaji iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eemeeda Gadi ea fuga gheanyaawa, fuga gheeh Sifoni, fuga dooshta Sifoni; fuga Hagi, ea fuga dooshta Hagi; fuga Shuni, ea fuga dooshta Shuni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuga Esboni, ea fuga dooshta Esboni; fuga Eri, ea fuga dooshta Eri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga Arodi, ea fuga dooshta Arodi; fuga Areli, ea fuga dooshta Areli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Gadi aba gisiyiitiida aba gheanyaawa, sagalamnyoojiga ea haradam ea bughalaji muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yuda, Eri gil ea Onani; nea fiisu was Eri ea Onaniin gameewiisa ng'eanyiida Ganaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Yuda aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Shela, ea fuga dooshta Shela; fuga Beresi, ea fuga dooshta Beresi; fuga Sera, ea fuga dooshta Sera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga gheeh Beresi ea: fuga Hesroni gil, ea fuga dooshta Hesroni; fuga Hamuli, ea fuga dooshta Hamuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Yuda gil siyiitiisa gheanyaawa, ea sagalamnyooji laadam ea damwalah ea bughalaji muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Isakari aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Dola, fuga gheeh Dola; fuga gheeh Bufa, fuga gheeh Buni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuga Yashubu, fuga gheeh Yashubu, fuga Shimroni, fuga gheeh Shimroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga gheeh Isakari aba giteena mooneeda nyaawa, ea sagalamnyooji laadam ea ang'wan ea bughalaji samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Sabuloni aba gidabeada gheanyaawa, fuga Seredi, fuga gheeh Seredi; fuga Eloni, fuga gheeh Eloni; fuga Yaleeli, fuga gheeh Yaleeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga gheeh Sabuloni aba giteena mooneeda nyaawa, ea sagalamnyooji laadam ea bughalaji muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yosefu aba gidabeada gheanyaawa, Manase gil ea Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Manase, fuga Makiri, ea fuga gheeh Makiri; nea Makiri ea ghweanda Gileyadi; fuga Gileyadi, fuga gheeh Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Gileyadi; fuga Abieseri, fuga gheeh Abieseri; fuga Heleki, fuga gheeh Heleki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gea Asrieli, fuga gheeh Asrieli; ea gea Shekemu, fuga gheeh Shekemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea Shemida, fuga gheeh Shemida; gea Heferi, fuga gheeh Heferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Selofehadi orjeeda Heferi ea mandeawana orjooga, geaghus haweega; nea gheawungeaba haweesu bea Selofehadiin ea suh, Mala gil, ea Nuhu, ea Hogla, ea Milka, ea Dirsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Manaseehi; nea fuga siyiitiisa gheanyaawa ea sagalamnyooji haradam ea damaniyeenya ea bughalaji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Efraimu aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Shutela, fuga gheeh Shutela; fuga Beredi, fuga gheeh Beredi; fuga Dahati, fuga gheeh Dahati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Shutela ea suh; fuga Erani, ea fuga gheeh Erani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Efraimu siyiitiisa gheanyaawa, ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea damaniyeenya ea bughalaji muut. Suh diibiga Yosefu gil aba giteena fuga gheanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Benjamini aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Bela, ea fuga gheeh Bela; ea fuga Ashbeli, fuga gheeh Ashbeli; fuga Ahiramu, fuga gheeh Ahiramu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuga Shufamu, fuga gheeh Shufamu; fuga Hufamu, fuga gheeh Hufamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Bela ea Ardi ea Naamani; suh Ardi, fuga gheeh Ardi; fuga Naamani, fuga gheeh Naamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh dooshta Benjamini gil aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga siyiitiisa gheanyaawa ea sagalamnyooji haradam ea muut ea bughalaji lah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Dani suh ea fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Shuhamu, fuga gheeh Shuhamu. Suh fuga gheeh Dani gil aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga sean bea gheeh Shuhamu was fuga siyiitiisa gheanyaawa, ea sagalamnyooji laadam ea ang'wan ea bughalaji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Asheri ea gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Imna, fuga gheeh Imna; fuga Ishfi, fuga gheeh Ishfi; fuga Beriya, fuga gheeh Beriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gea orjooga Beriya; fuga Heberi, fuga gheeh Heberi; fuga Malkieli, fuga gheeh Malkieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheawunga hudeaba Asheri geeguura Sera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga orjooga Asheri siyiitiisa gheanyaawa, ea sagalamnyooji haradam ea damasamwagu ea bughalaji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Naftali ea gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; fuga Yaseli, fuga gheeh Yaseli; ea fuga Guni, fuga gheeh Guni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuga Yeseri, fuga gheeh Yeseri; fuga Shilemu, fuga gheeh Shilemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Naftali aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; ak geeyiitiisa gheanyaawa ea sagalamnyooji haradam ea muut ea bughalaji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga siyiida aba jeeda fuga Israeli, ea sagalamnyooji bughalaji lah ea agi, ea bughalaji ispwa ea diktam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Musa ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Fiisu gajeelakiisa ng'eanyiini ak gwahearan ghoah daanyaawa, aba giteena mooneeda gheawunga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eemeeda burda seang'ayda gajadawa heeda haw jea gwahearan, nea gea ng'ay mooneeda nyaawa gajadawa heeda jea gwahearan aba giteena ng'ayinda nyaawa; giliwas sih aba mooneeda fugaaschi siyiida, nih gichea gwadeena hearaniischoadaanyi jea eataw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'eanyiida gajeelaja aba ng'alealeesiinda, aba giteena gheawunga buuneeda aba ghweaniga nyaawa nih gichea gwahearaniischeata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeelakiisa hearaniischooda nyaawa nea gang'alealeesa fuga saang'a ea gea ng'ay.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga eemeeda Lawi siyiida aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa; gea Gershoni, fuga gheeh Gershoni; gea Gohati, fuga gheeh Gohati; gea Merari, fuga gheeh Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga dooshta Lawi gil; fuga gheeh Libni, ea fuga gheeh Hebroni, ea fuga gheeh Mala, ea fuga gheeh Mushite, ea fuga gheeh Gora. Nea Gora ea ghweanda Amramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheawunga gatmooda Amramu geeguura Yokebedi was hudeaba Lawi ghayi jih Lawi aba ng'eanyiida Misri; ak gwajiilsa Yokebedi Amramu Haruni, ea Musa, ea huda ghaamwat siguura Miriyamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Haruni geejiilsa suh, Nadabu, ea Abihu, ea Eliyasari, ea Itamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghami Nadabu ea Abihu, damanda adaydaawa beasta mii ghaydit aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga siyiitiisa gheanyaawa ea sagalamnyooji diktam ea samwagu, giliwas ng'eedeeda bea sheanagi ghana ghwanaawa; aba gideaba meeyiita sea fuga Israeli, aba gideaba mwanyasa hearaniischooda aba jeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga iida Musa ea Eleyasareeda was ashoohoocheanda; was fuga ghayi iida fuga Israeli aba ng'eanyiida awiida bea Moabu, neekeewa Yordani mida ng'eanyiida Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeedeaba fiisu ea manda eara siyagi aba jeedeaba fugiga iida Musa ea Haruneeda was ashoohoocheanda; dea iida fuga Israeli aba dareapcheeda Sinayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 26:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badahuuka nyaawa, “Gaygameewiisa jeeda dareapcheeda.” Ak ea manda siida abit aba jeenyaawa geaghus Galebu orjeeda Yefune, sea Yoshuwa orjeeda Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.26.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.26.65"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
